OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers urge people to 'be
OL,4,Apatient' amid drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers and animal charities say this
OL,7,Fsummer's heatwaves and droughts have
OL,8,Fhad a "huge impact" on crops and feed.
OL,10,FMeteorologists have said summer 2026 is
OL,11,Fon course to be the Channel Islands'
OL,12,Fhottest since records began, with
OL,13,Ftemperatures reaching as high as 39.3C
OL,14,F(102.74F) in Jersey in June before it
OL,15,Fwas later declared in drought.
OL,17,FClairval Organic Dairy Farm near
OL,18,FMaufant said in a post on social media
OL,19,Fthe weather was "tough" for growers and
OL,20,Fdairy farmers and staff were urging
OL,21,Fpeople to "be patient" about supplies
OL,22,Fand prices.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
