OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers urge people to 'be
OL,4,Apatient' amid drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebecca Hefford, owner of animal
OL,7,Fcharity Paws and Claws, in St Mary,
OL,8,Fsaid "it's been very difficult" and the
OL,9,Fpredicted hotter summers would be a
OL,10,F"disaster" for farmers.
